        "custom_html": "<div class=\"warranty-section\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2644/2852/files/10_years_1.png?v=1758890447\" alt=\"10-year warranty icon\">\n  <span>Garantie de 10 ans</span>\n</div>",
